Subject: [PATCH 1/4] pic: pic_dither_sharp, each pixel its nearest pen (Sharp)

Erez, 5 Nov 2026 (EPDF's, the hub's yes to common): a picture of few
colours on 16 colours or fewer, a screenshot or a diagram, drawn with
each pixel's nearest pen, no dither (its letters were dots). The
dither's own way without room for its errors, asked for: the rows
freed, row_two and row_many's nearest pens. Off unless the caller asks
(EWeb and EPlay unchanged); EPDF asks for palette pictures of up to 128
colours.

tests/pic: -S (run.py's step): on 2 and 16 pens, every pixel of a
gradient's rows its pic_pal_nearest; the dither's rows differ (768
pens of 2048).

